{"study_accession":"PRJNA358580","secondary_study_accession":"SRP095538","title":"RNA sequencing data of whole blood cells of normal glucose tolerant (NGT) and gestational diabetes (GDM) pregnant women","description":"Total RNA was isolated from WBCs. For the analysis of genome-wide expression differences in small non-coding RNAs (sncRNAs) and long-coding and non-coding RNAs (mRNAs and lncRNAs), NGT and GDM pregnant women were selected. Twenty-nine GDM-associated mature micro-RNAs (miRNAs) with increased expression and one hundred sixty-three mRNAs with reduced expression associated with GDM were found (P<0.05 and FDR<0.1). Overall design: Eight NGT and eight GDM women were matched based on body-mass-index and age. Paired data was adjusted for mid-pregnancy weight gain and pregnancy week.","pubmed":"29358694","geo_series":"","n_samples":16,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN06175188","study_accession":"PRJNA358580","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"RNA-Seq GD14 Index21","description":"RNA-Seq GD14 Index21","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM2437191","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2018-01-03","attributes":[["source_name","whole blood cells"],["health status","GDM"],["individual id","GD14"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR5125901","experiment_accession":"SRX2440291","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":81917491,"base_count":16547333182,"first_public":"2018-01-03","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM2437191: RNA-Seq GD14 Index21 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN06175189","study_accession":"PRJNA358580","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"RNA-Seq GD13 Index20","description":"RNA-Seq GD13 Index20","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM2437190","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2018-01-03","attributes":[["source_name","whole blood cells"],["health status","NGT"],["indi